      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto rounded-lg p-8" style="background-color:hsl(var(--eden-forest))">
        <p class="font-accent text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3" style="color:hsl(var(--eden-gold))">Fifty Founding Families</p>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Anyone can preorder. Fifty families get to shape what comes next.</h4>
        <p class="font-body text-sm mb-5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)">The first fifty families to order are the Founding Families. Not a label, a role. This is what it carries:</p>
